## 🔊 8. CENTRAL AUDIO ENGINE (`src/utils/audioEngine.js`)

* **Anti-Chaos Queue:** All `playSfx()` and `playVoice()` calls execute `stopAllSFXAndVoices()` first to eliminate sound overlapping during rapid hovering/tapping.
* **Fail-Safe Missing Files:** WebAudio helper catches missing `/public/audio/*.mp3` assets silently without crashing React.
* **Audio Triggers:**
  * `bgm_intro` (Hogwarts BGM loop)
  * `sfx_wax_crack` (Seal break)
  * `sfx_wand_swish` (NO button hover)
  * `voice_no_nice_try` (NO trap response)
  * `sfx_spell_quest` / `voice_tap_yay` (YES acceptance)
  * `sfx_cat_meow` / `sfx_cat_purr` (Ginger interactions)
  * `sfx_chipmunk_giggle` (Mini-Me face tap)
